jawi.onnx and labels.json

A conversion of the Jawi line recognition model "Jawi-OCR-Kraken-v1" by budaya-lab
(https://huggingface.co/budaya-lab/Jawi-OCR-Kraken-v1), licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Changes made: the published Kraken model file (real_plus_synth_200_best_250326.mlmodel,
SHA-256 00153e3f89c6428473887aa45dd85b5d187ee5e43c0a3c0872c4bbeba3b1d334) was exported unchanged
in its weights to the ONNX format, and its alphabet was written out as labels.json, with
scripts/convert_jawi_model.py. The outputs of the two files were compared on random lines of five
widths and differ by less than 0.00002.

That model was in turn fine-tuned by its authors from the Kraken printed Arabic base model
(https://zenodo.org/records/7050270).
